{"lyrics":"[00:02.64] All on my mind, yeah\n[00:06.18] All on my mind\n[00:09.86] Yeah, late nights, hmm\n[00:14.10] Know you know this already, but girl you're all on my mind\n[00:17.56] Don't know why I feel the need to tell you several times (Amen)\n[00:21.84] Woke up thanking God, glad that you're mine\n[00:23.92] Pray you here 'cause you love me, not 'cause I was the only thing you could find (Thing you could find)\n[00:28.56] Oh, I've been used and abused a lot, but so have you\n[00:31.88] You know the pain of being left for dead\n[00:34.50] I know it too, my heart's feeling fresh again (Again), again, oh\n[00:42.28] Oh, I've been used and abused a lot, but so have you\n[00:45.58] You know the pain of being left for dead\n[00:48.24] I know it too, my heart's feeling fresh again (Again), again, oh\n[00:55.74] Left to rot, bleed out and die\n[00:57.88] Been through a lot in such a short amount of time\n[01:01.92] You're in my car of life, hope you're enjoying the ride\n[01:05.06] Give me your heart as admission to this rollercoaster ride (Yeah)\n[01:09.82] Wouldn't make it if you weren't here by my side (Yeah)\n[01:12.78] I'd be drowning in the Devil's high tide (Yeah)\n[01:16.70] Every time that I look you in the eyes\n[01:19.64] Somethin' tells me things are gonna be alright\n[01:22.22] Oh-oh (Oh-oh), oh-oh (Oh-oh), oh-oh (Oh-oh)\n[01:31.22] You just make me believe that (Everything's gon' be alright)\n[01:37.98] It's crazy that, oh-oh (Oh-oh), oh-oh (Oh-oh), oh-oh (Oh-oh)\n[01:40.90] The influence somebody can have over another person (Oh-oh, oh)\n[01:49.66] (Thing you could find, you could find)\n[01:51.04] Oh, I've been used and abused a lot, but so have you\n[01:54.28] You know the pain of being left for dead\n[01:56.82] I know it too, my heart's feeling fresh again (Again), again, oh\n[02:04.64] Oh, I've been used and abused a lot, but so have you\n[02:07.88] You know the pain of being left for dead\n[02:10.52] I know it too, my heart's feeling fresh again (Again), again, oh\n[02:17.34] I know that you would never ever, ever do me wrong\n[02:20.16] I know I made mistakes, but I want this forever\n[02:23.08] Lifelong love, lifelong trust, life long us\n[02:28.20] And if I can't get that, then I'ma bite the dust\n[02:31.32] I know we argue sometimes, that's the fight in us\n[02:34.88] But that's passion, I need passion (Yeah), everlasting\n[02:40.08] Let's focus on the future, let the past pass us (Let's let the past pass us)\n[02:45.82] There ain't no way (Oh-oh), I'll make my way home (Oh-oh)\n[02:52.68] Without you here (Oh-oh), because you're my home (Oh-oh)\n[02:59.54] My pain, it shows (Oh-oh), you heal the wounds (Oh-oh)\n[03:07.00] I hold you close (Oh-oh), 'til I become consumed (Oh-oh)\n[03:13.22] There ain't no way, I'll make my way home\n[03:20.10] Without you here, because you're my home\n[03:27.22] My pain, it shows, you heal the wounds\n[03:34.46] I hold you close, 'til I become consumed\n[03:39.34] Know you know this already, but girl you're all on my mind\n[03:43.28] Don't know why I feel the need to tell you several times (Amen)\n[03:47.54] Woke up thanking God, glad that you're mine\n[03:51.16] Pray you here 'cause you love me, not 'cause I was the only thing you could find (Thing you could find, you could find)","words":[[0.0,0.02,"[00:02.66]"],[2.64,2.78,"All"],[2.86,2.94,"on"],[3.0,3.14,"my"],[3.2,3.48,"mind,"],[4.7,6.1,"yeah"],[6.12,6.14,"[00:06.18]"],[6.18,6.24,"All"],[6.28,6.32,"on"],[6.42,6.46,"my"],[6.62,7.72,"mind"],[7.74,8.66,"[00:09.90]"],[9.86,9.96,"Yeah,"],[10.46,10.6,"late"],[10.68,11.0,"nights,"],[11.04,11.16,"hmm"],[11.18,13.88,"[00:14.12]"],[14.1,14.26,"Know"],[14.36,14.44,"you"],[14.52,14.68,"know"],[14.74,14.94,"this"],[15.04,15.48,"already,"],[15.6,15.74,"but"],[15.82,16.0,"girl"],[16.04,16.26,"you're"],[16.34,16.46,"all"],[16.54,16.62,"on"],[16.66,16.68,"my"],[16.88,17.14,"mind"],[17.16,17.28,"[00:17.62]"],[17.56,17.7,"Don't"],[17.74,17.98,"know"],[18.16,18.2,"why"],[18.24,18.24